WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
indeed

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,360
If you can't deal with it easily

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:05,660
She should have withdrawn long ago

4
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:06,940
Smile at this Lin Mo

5
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,380
What kind of monster is he?

6
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,780
Don't you guys look at me like that, honestly

7
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,300
Even I didn't expect it

8
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,550
How can she perform like this?

9
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:17,510
I knew it

10
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,550
This bastard must not be able to endure it

11
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,550
Thirteen days seems to be only five days away

12
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,940
But converted to one hundred and twenty hours

13
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,820
In the extremely stressful wilderness

14
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,900
It's longer than a century

15
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,030
Now there are only three seeds left

16
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:32,690
I don’t know who will come out in the end.

17
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,330
Number one representing Lin Mo

18
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:35,930
Personnel number eight

19
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:38,340
And Gu Haining’s No. 6

20
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:40,100
How about we make a bet again?

21
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,540
Bet on who can break the eighteen-day stay record

22
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:45,620
It's better to be scolded by Caitou than to be a beauty with a hundred thousand dollars.

23
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,370
I crush Lin Mo

24
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:48,770
I suppress the staff

25
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:51,260
I crush Gu Haining

26
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,620
Now that our two families are out

27
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:54,820
Then Teacher Yu and I will make sure no one can break the record.

28
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:55,780
If no one breaks

29
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:58,780
It's settled that the money will belong to our two families.
